
Welcome to RustMUD!

This is the immortal MOTD -- the file that immortals will see when they
log in to the game.  You should change it to something more interesting
when you get a chance (as well as most of the other files in lib/text.)

This server is a from-scratch Rust rewrite of tbaMUD, which is itself a
CircleMUD derivative.  It is not tbaMUD and is not supported by them: do
not take questions about this server to the tbaMUD staff or forums.

